# jacques writes its own OTel log to ./jacques/jacques.log, relative to the
# working directory -- so running jacques FROM THIS REPO leaves an untracked
# jacques/ here. The file carries query text, tenant and client ids. Root-anchored
# so it can only ever match that stray directory, never a real path deeper in.
/jacques/
